doc: TVanguard: the Vanguard card type (CR 205.2). A Vanguard is not a permanent: kgen still builds the bit on a lowered command-zone static carrier (Sisay's TapsForMana static, lower_tapextra.go), but the kernel reads no Vanguard type mask -- it classifies a command-zone static by its zone alone (static_classgates.go prepStaticClasses, a Vanguard's or a face-up plane's).
